Description:
 Manual roller shutter door inspections;
 5 yearly electrical inspection;
 Structural and building fabric inspection.

Following the inspections there is a possibility the systems will require remedials works to obtain compliance. This Contract also allows for a Limit of Liability to conduct those remedial works

The requirement is to provide subject matter and technical expertise to in service support to Outfit 4KMA. The requirement will include, but not limited to the following activities:
1.	SME technical support to programme activities:  
a.	Attendance at working groups to include but not limited to SWG, expected frequency of each meeting will be between 2 to 3 months.

2.	Support to include but not limited to testing and assurance activities:
a.	The provision of technical support at locations in the UK in performing and/or witnessing test, integration and acceptance activities subject to the solution test plan;
b.	Stakeholder liaison and attendance at test and transition working groups;
c.	Writing and / or reviewing individual test plans;
d.	Use and operation of the Communications Development and Integration Facility (CDIF) at QinetiQ Portsdown Technology Park.

3.	Support to include but not limited to security and accreditation activities:
a.	The provision of security direction to develop security documentation to meet MOD requirements;
b.	The provision of security direction to achieve accreditation to meet MOD requirements;
c.	Writing and / or reviewing security documents;
d.	Stakeholder liaison and attendance at SWG;

4.	Support to include in-service support to further support Thales. This will be 2nd line support:
a.	May require attending some platforms in the UK;
